Experience Monitoring (VAPT) — production ops

Full guide: deploy/experience-monitoring-production.md
Deploy path: FORCE_RESET=1 ./deploy/release.sh deploy  (host Horizon, NOT docker horizon)

Always run from: /var/www/vendorpulse  (NOT /var/www/exportdoc)

---

Deploy

cd /var/www/vendorpulse
FORCE_RESET=1 ./deploy/release.sh deploy
./deploy/verify_vapt.sh

---

VAPT broken after deploy — fix now

1) Wrong Node path in .env (very common)
   php artisan optimize caches EXPERIENCE_MONITORING_RUNNER_COMMAND
   Remove dev nvm path; use server node:
   which node
   # edit .env:
   # EXPERIENCE_MONITORING_RUNNER_COMMAND=/usr/bin/node
   # PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=/var/www/vendorpulse/.playwright-browsers

cd /var/www/vendorpulse
npm run experience-monitoring:install
php artisan config:clear
php artisan optimize
./deploy/workers_up.sh
./deploy/verify_vapt.sh

2) Stop Docker workers (this server uses host Horizon)
docker compose stop horizon scheduler app
./deploy/workers_up.sh

3) Check failures
php artisan queue:failed
tail -n 80 storage/logs/horizon-host.log

4) Create test fails — select one organization in dashboard (not All organizations)

